        "Active \u00b7 sound on"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Play and pause feedback",
      "group": "Media",
      "note": "48px, FILL 1, #BEFC4F. These are transient feedback icons after a tap, rather than permanent selected states.",
      "states": [
        "Play feedback",
        "Pause feedback"
      ]
    },
